Q6. Display the last name, job designation, and salary of all employees who work as Programmers or Shipping Clerks and whose salary is not equal to $4,500, $10,000, or $15,000.
SQL Query:
SELECT last_name, job_id, salary
FROM employees
WHERE job_id IN ('IT_PROG', 'ST_CLERK')
AND salary NOT IN (4500, 10000, 15000);
